  "limits": [
    "Legacy matmul and SwiGLU retain explicit partial BML numerical contracts. The configurable matmul validates each real BML operation; no all-f64 BLAS or universal evaluability claim.",
    "The checked matmul preflight validates supplied values; callers must bind those values and owned constants to valid disjoint buffer storage.",
